<TEI xmlns="http://www.tei-c.org/ns/1.0" xml:id="CH8x3403-zh-0a01d8a7" type="transl"><teiHeader><fileDesc><titleStmt><title>by 睡虎地秦墓竹简整理小组</title><editor role="translator">TLS Project</editor></titleStmt><publicationStmt><ab>published electronically as part of the TLS project at https://hxwd.org</ab><availability status="2"><ab>This work has been licensed for use in the TLS</ab></availability></publicationStmt><sourceDesc><bibl><title>by 睡虎地秦墓竹简整理小组</title>2026</bibl><ab>Translation of <bibl corresp="#CH8x3403"><title xml:lang="och"/></bibl> into <lang xml:lang="zh">modern Chinese</lang>.</ab></sourceDesc></fileDesc><profileDesc><creation resp="#Runtian">Initially created: <date>2026-05-11T02:39:45.748+09:00</date> by Runtian</creation></profileDesc></teiHeader><text><body><div><head>Translated parts</head><p xml:id="CH8x3403-start"><seg corresp="#CH8x3403_CHANT_001-1a.1" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#Runtian" modified="2026-05-11T02:47:30.315+09:00">下了及時的雨</seg><seg corresp="#CH8x3403_CHANT_001-1a.2" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#Runtian" modified="2026-05-11T02:47:42.862+09:00">和谷物抽穗，</seg><seg corresp="#CH8x3403_CHANT_001-1a.3" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#Runtian" modified="2026-05-11T02:50:06.229+09:00">應及時書麵報告受雨、</seg><seg corresp="#CH8x3403_CHANT_001-1a.4" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#Runtian" modified="2026-05-11T02:50:11.026+09:00">抽穗的頃數和已開墾而沒有耕種的田地的頃數。</seg><seg corresp="#CH8x3403_CHANT_001-1a.5" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#Runtian" modified="2026-05-11T02:50:32.14+09:00">禾稼生長後下了雨，</seg><seg corresp="#CH8x3403_CHANT_001-1a.6" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#Runtian" modified="2026-05-11T02:50:50.298+09:00">也要立即報告雨量多少，</seg><seg corresp="#CH8x3403_CHANT_001-1a.7" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#Runtian" modified="2026-05-11T02:51:02.002+09:00">和受益田地的頃數。</seg><seg corresp="#CH8x3403_CHANT_001-1a.8" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#Runtian" modified="2026-05-11T02:51:21.16+09:00">如有旱災、暴風雨、</seg><seg corresp="#CH8x3403_CHANT_001-1a.9" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#Runtian" modified="2026-05-11T02:51:29.97+09:00">澇災、</seg><seg corresp="#CH8x3403_CHANT_001-1a.10" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#Runtian" modified="2026-05-11T02:51:37.726+09:00">蝗蟲、</seg><seg corresp="#CH8x3403_CHANT_001-1a.11" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#Runtian" modified="2026-05-11T02:51:45.864+09:00">其他害蟲等災害損傷了禾稼，</seg><seg corresp="#CH8x3403_CHANT_001-1a.12" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#Runtian" modified="2026-05-11T02:51:56.243+09:00">也要報告受災頃數。</seg><seg corresp="#CH8x3403_CHANT_001-1a.13" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#Runtian" modified="2026-05-11T02:52:08.534+09:00">距離近的縣，文書由走得快得人專程遞送，</seg><seg corresp="#CH8x3403_CHANT_001-1a.14" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#Runtian" modified="2026-05-11T02:52:19.93+09:00">距離遠的縣由驛站傳送，</seg><seg corresp="#CH8x3403_CHANT_001-1a.16" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#Runtian" modified="2026-05-11T02:52:51.406+09:00">田律。</seg><seg corresp="#CH8x3403_CHANT_001-2a.1" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#Runtian" modified="2026-05-11T03:11:44.316+09:00">春天二月，</seg><seg corresp="#CH8x3403_CHANT_001-2a.2" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#Runtian" modified="2026-05-11T03:11:57.286+09:00">不準到山林中砍伐木材，不準堵塞水道。</seg><seg corresp="#CH8x3403_CHANT_001-2a.3" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#Runtian" modified="2026-05-11T03:12:07.875+09:00">不到夏季，</seg><seg corresp="#CH8x3403_CHANT_001-2a.4" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#Runtian" modified="2026-05-11T03:12:17.931+09:00">不準燒草作爲肥料，</seg><seg corresp="#CH8x3403_CHANT_001-2a.5" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#Runtian" modified="2026-05-11T03:12:25.575+09:00">不準採取剛髮芽的植物，</seg><seg corresp="#CH8x3403_CHANT_001-2a.6" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#Runtian" modified="2026-05-11T03:12:41.11+09:00">或捉取幼獸、鳥卵和幼鳥，</seg><seg corresp="#CH8x3403_CHANT_001-2a.7" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#Runtian" modified="2026-05-11T03:12:52.772+09:00">不準毒殺魚鱉、</seg><seg corresp="#CH8x3403_CHANT_001-2a.8" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#Runtian" modified="2026-05-11T03:13:07.001+09:00">不準設置捕捉鳥獸的陷阱和網罟，</seg><seg corresp="#CH8x3403_CHANT_001-2a.9" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#Runtian" modified="2026-05-11T03:13:15.147+09:00">到七月解除禁令。</seg><seg corresp="#CH8x3403_CHANT_001-2a.10" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#Runtian" modified="2026-05-11T03:13:26.658+09:00">隻有因有死亡而需伐木製造棺槨的，</seg><seg corresp="#CH8x3403_CHANT_001-2a.11" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#Runtian" modified="2026-05-11T03:13:35.669+09:00">不受季節限製。</seg><seg corresp="#CH8x3403_CHANT_001-2a.12" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#Runtian" modified="2026-05-11T03:13:49.496+09:00">居邑靠近養牛馬的皂和其它禁苑的，</seg><seg corresp="#CH8x3403_CHANT_001-2a.13" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#Runtian" modified="2026-05-11T03:14:01.963+09:00">幼獸繁殖時不準帶着狗去狩獵。</seg><seg corresp="#CH8x3403_CHANT_001-2a.14" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#Runtian" modified="2026-05-11T03:14:27.909+09:00">百姓的狗進入禁苑而沒有追獸和捕獸的，</seg><seg corresp="#CH8x3403_CHANT_001-2a.15" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#Runtian" modified="2026-05-11T03:14:36.516+09:00">不準打死;</seg><seg corresp="#CH8x3403_CHANT_001-2a.16" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#Runtian" modified="2026-05-11T03:14:49.636+09:00">如追獸和捕獸，</seg><seg corresp="#CH8x3403_CHANT_001-2a.17" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#Runtian" modified="2026-05-11T03:15:03.099+09:00">要打死。</seg><seg corresp="#CH8x3403_CHANT_001-2a.18" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#Runtian" modified="2026-05-11T03:15:25.12+09:00">在專門設置警戒的地區打死的狗，</seg><seg corresp="#CH8x3403_CHANT_001-2a.19" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#Runtian" modified="2026-05-11T03:15:32.265+09:00">都要完整地上繳官府;</seg><seg corresp="#CH8x3403_CHANT_001-2a.20" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#Runtian" modified="2026-05-11T03:15:42.558+09:00">其他禁苑打死的，</seg><seg corresp="#CH8x3403_CHANT_001-2a.21" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#Runtian" modified="2026-05-11T03:15:50.594+09:00">可以吃掉狗肉而上繳狗皮。</seg><seg corresp="#CH8x3403_CHANT_001-2a.22" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#Runtian" modified="2026-05-11T03:15:56.872+09:00">田律。</seg><seg corresp="#CH8x3403_CHANT_001-3a.1" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#Runtian" modified="2026-05-11T03:20:53.423+09:00">每頃田地應繳的芻稾，</seg><seg corresp="#CH8x3403_CHANT_001-3a.2" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#Runtian" modified="2026-05-11T03:21:20.026+09:00">按照所受田地的數量繳納，</seg><seg corresp="#CH8x3403_CHANT_001-3a.3" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#Runtian" modified="2026-05-11T03:22:02.297+09:00">不論耕種與否，</seg><seg corresp="#CH8x3403_CHANT_001-3a.4" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#Runtian" modified="2026-05-11T03:22:11.348+09:00">每頃繳納芻三石、</seg><seg corresp="#CH8x3403_CHANT_001-3a.5" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#Runtian" modified="2026-05-11T03:22:18.866+09:00">稾二石。</seg><seg corresp="#CH8x3403_CHANT_001-3a.6" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#Runtian" modified="2026-05-11T03:22:28.267+09:00">芻從幹葉和亂草夠一束以上均收。</seg><seg corresp="#CH8x3403_CHANT_001-3a.7" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#Runtian" modified="2026-05-11T03:22:36.786+09:00">繳納芻稾時，</seg><seg corresp="#CH8x3403_CHANT_001-3a.8" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#Runtian" modified="2026-05-11T03:22:48.375+09:00">可以運來稱量。</seg><seg corresp="#CH8x3403_CHANT_001-3a.10" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#Runtian" modified="2026-05-11T03:22:56.266+09:00">田律。</seg><seg corresp="#CH8x3403_CHANT_001-4a.2" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#Runtian" modified="2026-05-11T03:28:40.726+09:00">芻稾撤下木頭和</seg><seg corresp="#CH8x3403_CHANT_001-4a.3" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#Runtian" modified="2026-05-11T03:28:45.877+09:00">草墊，</seg><seg corresp="#CH8x3403_CHANT_001-4a.4" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#Runtian" modified="2026-05-11T03:28:55.886+09:00">應即向縣廷報告糧草石數。</seg><seg corresp="#CH8x3403_CHANT_001-4a.5" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#Runtian" modified="2026-05-11T03:29:11.261+09:00">木頭和草墊不要移作他用，</seg><seg corresp="#CH8x3403_CHANT_001-4a.6" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#Runtian" modified="2026-05-11T03:29:18.912+09:00">要再用來墊蓋糧草。</seg><seg corresp="#CH8x3403_CHANT_001-4a.7" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#Runtian" modified="2026-05-11T03:29:25.212+09:00">田律。</seg><seg corresp="#CH8x3403_CHANT_001-5a.1" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#Runtian" modified="2026-05-11T03:32:10.563+09:00">駕車牛馬的飼料，</seg><seg corresp="#CH8x3403_CHANT_001-5a.2" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#Runtian" modified="2026-05-11T03:32:40.755+09:00">過期兩個月沒有領取</seg><seg corresp="#CH8x3403_CHANT_001-5a.4" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#Runtian" modified="2026-05-11T03:32:28.672+09:00">都截止，</seg><seg corresp="#CH8x3403_CHANT_001-5a.3" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#Runtian" modified="2026-05-11T03:32:43.783+09:00">或髮送的，</seg><seg corresp="#CH8x3403_CHANT_001-5a.5" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#Runtian" modified="2026-05-11T03:33:00.506+09:00">不再領</seg><seg corresp="#CH8x3403_CHANT_001-5a.6" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#Runtian" modified="2026-05-11T03:33:03.638+09:00">髮。</seg><seg corresp="#CH8x3403_CHANT_001-5a.7" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#Runtian" modified="2026-05-11T03:33:16.227+09:00">向大田領取而未設固定賬目的，</seg><seg corresp="#CH8x3403_CHANT_001-5a.8" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#Runtian" modified="2026-05-11T03:33:23.725+09:00">按照其領取憑証所到日期髮給，</seg><seg corresp="#CH8x3403_CHANT_001-5a.9" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#Runtian" modified="2026-05-11T03:33:30.273+09:00">不得超過憑証的規定。</seg><seg corresp="#CH8x3403_CHANT_001-5a.10" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#Runtian" modified="2026-05-11T03:33:36.134+09:00">田律。</seg><seg corresp="#CH8x3403_CHANT_001-6a.1" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#Runtian" modified="2026-05-11T03:36:06.82+09:00">居住在農村的百姓不準賣酒，</seg><seg corresp="#CH8x3403_CHANT_001-6a.2" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#Runtian" modified="2026-05-11T03:36:30.481+09:00">由嗇夫</seg><seg corresp="#CH8x3403_CHANT_001-6a.3" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#Runtian" modified="2026-05-11T03:36:38.804+09:00">及部佐應嚴加禁止，</seg><seg corresp="#CH8x3403_CHANT_001-6a.4" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#Runtian" modified="2026-05-11T03:36:49.017+09:00">違反法令的有罪。</seg><seg corresp="#CH8x3403_CHANT_001-6a.5" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#Runtian" modified="2026-05-11T03:36:54.215+09:00">田律。</seg></p></div></body></text></TEI>